sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Admin as Security Administrator
    participant UI as Dashboard UI (React 18)
    participant API as REST API (FastAPI)
    participant ACL as AccessController (icacls)
    participant FS as Windows NTFS (Kernel)
    participant Watch as Watchdog / ETW Observer
    participant Vault as Rollback Vault (AES-256)
    participant DB as SQLCipher Database
    participant Notify as Alert Dispatcher (SMS/Email)
    actor Attacker as Ransomware / Adversary

    %% Phase 1: Critical Registration & Auto-Lock
    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
    Note over Admin,DB: Phase 1: Registration of Critical Monitored Asset with Auto-Lock
    Admin->>UI: Register Folder as "CRITICAL" & define Unlock Password
    UI->>API: POST /files/register?file_path=C:\Target&tier=critical&unlock_password=Pass
    API->>ACL: lock_path(C:\Target)
    ACL->>FS: Execute icacls C:\Target /deny Everyone:(W,AD,WEA,WA) /T /C /Q
    FS-->>ACL: Discretionary ACL Applied (Write Access Denied)
    API->>Vault: Create encrypted pre-lock baseline snapshot
    Vault->>FS: Mirror and compress files
    Vault-->>API: Snapshot encrypted (AES-256-GCM)
    API->>DB: INSERT INTO baselines (path, SHA-256, is_locked=1, pwd_hash)
    API->>DB: INSERT INTO audit_log (action="REGISTER_CRITICAL_AUTOLOCK", outcome="SUCCESS")
    API-->>UI: 200 OK: Asset Registered, Secured & Auto-Locked
    UI-->>Admin: Display 🔒 "Locked (DENY Write)" & 🔑 "Protected" Badges
    end

    %% Phase 2: Active Adversarial Attack Neutralization
    rect rgb(255, 240, 245)
    Note over Attacker,Notify: Phase 2: Adversarial Attack & Kernel-Level Prevention
    Attacker->>FS: Executes bulk modification / XOR encryption attack
    FS--xAttacker: ACCESS DENIED (0x80070005) enforced by Windows NT Kernel!
    Note over FS,Attacker: Attack Neutralized: Zero bytes encrypted or tampered!
    Watch->>FS: Intercepts low-level access denial & mutation attempts
    Watch->>API: Transmit event: ACCESS_DENIED / TAMPER_ATTEMPT (PID, ProcessName)
    API->>DB: Log incident in events and alerts tables
    API->>Notify: Trigger emergency alert (Twilio SMS & Resend Email)
    Notify-->>Admin: SMS & Email: "CRITICAL: Unauthorized Tamper Attempt Blocked on C:\Target"
    end

    %% Phase 3: Password-Gated Maintenance & Self-Healing Rollback
    rect rgb(245, 255, 250)
    Note over Admin,Vault: Phase 3: Password-Gated Maintenance & Vault Rollback
    Admin->>UI: Clicks 🔒 "Locked" to perform authorized maintenance
    UI-->>Admin: Prompts for Folder Unlock Passphrase in modal
    Admin->>UI: Enters Unlock Password
    UI->>API: POST /access/unlock (path=C:\Target, password=Pass)
    API->>DB: Query unlock_password_hash from baselines
    DB-->>API: Return stored SHA-256 hash
    
    alt Password Verification Fails
        API->>DB: INSERT INTO audit_log (action="UNLOCK_PATH", outcome="FAILED_INVALID_PASSWORD")
        API-->>UI: 403 Forbidden: "Incorrect unlock password"
        UI-->>Admin: Display Red Alert Banner: Access Denied
    else Password Verification Passes
        API->>ACL: unlock_path(C:\Target)
        ACL->>FS: Execute icacls C:\Target /remove:d Everyone /T /C /Q
        FS-->>ACL: DENY ACL removed, standard access restored
        API->>DB: UPDATE baselines SET is_locked=0
        API->>DB: INSERT INTO audit_log (action="UNLOCK_PATH", outcome="SUCCESS")
        API-->>UI: 200 OK: "Write access RESTORED"
        UI-->>Admin: Update Badge to 🔓 "Unlocked"
    end

    opt Emergency Self-Healing Rollback
        Admin->>UI: Clicks "Rollback to Clean Baseline"
        UI->>API: POST /rollback/execute (file_path=C:\Target\file.txt)
        API->>Vault: Retrieve encrypted mirror snapshot
        Vault->>Vault: Decrypt payload via AES-256-GCM & verify SHA-256
        Vault->>FS: Overwrite target with verified pristine baseline
        API->>DB: Update baselines and log audit event
        API-->>UI: 200 OK: "File restored to verified baseline"
        UI-->>Admin: Green Toast: "Asset restored with 100% fidelity"
    end
    end
